  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tamil Nadu Climate Resilient Urban Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The TA will have two subcomponents each to be implemented through the DMA and the TNUIFSL. The main activities will include (a) Program management and independent verification agency (IVA); (b) assessment of ULBs credit rating and exploring credit enhancement mechanism for municipal bonds; (c) communications, stakeholder, and WSS customers engagement at the ULBs; (d) training and capacity building for urban sector staff and ULB councilors on urban management and climate-resilient urban services, operationalizing and sustaining water supply services, developing and implementing CWIS and wastewater reuse, designing and managing WSS service O&amp;amp;M and PBCs, and preparing CCAPs; and (e) improving of e-governance and GIS mapping, and preparing of investment subprojects (outside of the Program). TA activities will incorporate gender awareness to ensure enhanced women&apos;s participation in capacity-building activities and also strengthen gender-inclusive data management and monitoring and evaluation (M&amp;amp;E) systems.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen urban management and improve access to efficient and climate resilient urban water and sanitation services in participating ULBs in Tamil Nadu</narrative>
  </description>
